# For the Birds (otherAreas 104): Oldton Movalpolos' Koblakiq (default 13), Castle Oztroja's Daa Bola the Seer (default
# HERETICS), Beadeaux's GeFhu Yagudoeye (default HUURR) and the NMs Magnes Quadav (MAGNES_QUADAV_NM 17379784, +2
# 17379786) and Nickel Quadav (NICKEL_QUADAV_NM = MAGNES + 1, 17379785; MAGNES + 3, 17379787). Missionary Moblin
# completed (a GM), its mustZone clear. Two Arnica Roots. A trade of a root to Daa Bola while For is available: no
# section; nothing. Koblakiq 14 (0, 1663), option 1: begun. Prog 0: 15 (event). Daa Bola Prog 0: 86 (event). The root
# traded: 87, finished: the root taken, Prog 1, mustZone 151. Daa Bola, mustZone: LETTING_YOU_GO; a rezone (the same
# zone): kept: LETTING_YOU_GO; a warp out: cleared. Koblakiq Prog 1: 16 (0, Glittering Fragment), finished: Prog 2, the
# fragment. Prog 2: 17 (event). Daa Bola Prog 2, no mustZone: nil (HERETICS). GeFhu Prog 2, none up: Prog 3, the four
# NMs spawned and claimed, the fragment taken (TAKEN_FROM_YOU), QUADAV_ARE_ATTACKING. Again (up, Option 0): nil (HUURR).
# The four killed: Option 4. GeFhu: 124, finished: Prog 4. Leaving Beadeaux at Prog 4 (onZoneOut, Prog >= 2): Option 0.
# Koblakiq Prog 4: 18, finished: completed (Jaguar Mantle), mustZone 11: 19. A warp out and back: Better the Demon's
# offer 20 (0, Demon Pen).
lists OldtonMovalpolos/Koblakiq/onTrigger OldtonMovalpolos/onEventFinish/14 OldtonMovalpolos/onEventFinish/16 OldtonMovalpolos/onEventFinish/18 CastleOztroja/Daa_Bola_the_Seer/onTrigger CastleOztroja/Daa_Bola_the_Seer/onTrade CastleOztroja/onEventFinish/87 Beadeaux/GeFhu_Yagudoeye/onTrigger Beadeaux/Magnes_Quadav_NM/onMobDeath Beadeaux/Nickel_Quadav_NM/onMobDeath Beadeaux/onZoneOut/1 Beadeaux/onEventFinish/124
char zone=CastleOztroja pos=-156.5,-17.2,193.5 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.MissionaryMoblin completed
item ArnicaRoot x2
login
trade Daa_Bola_the_Seer ArnicaRoot x1   # For available: no section; nothing
warp -63.4,22.8,-117.5 OldtonMovalpolos
trigger Koblakiq                        # available: 14 (0, 1663)
finish option=1                         # begun
trigger Koblakiq                        # Prog 0: 15
finish
warp -156.5,-17.2,193.5 CastleOztroja
trigger Daa_Bola_the_Seer               # Prog 0: 86
finish
trade Daa_Bola_the_Seer ArnicaRoot x1   # 87
finish                                  # the root taken; Prog 1; mustZone 151
trigger Daa_Bola_the_Seer               # Prog 1, mustZone: LETTING_YOU_GO
rezone                                  # the same zone: the mustZone kept
trigger Daa_Bola_the_Seer               # LETTING_YOU_GO again
warp -63.4,22.8,-117.5 OldtonMovalpolos # another zone: the mustZone cleared
trigger Koblakiq                        # Prog 1: 16 (0, Glittering Fragment)
finish                                  # Prog 2; the fragment
trigger Koblakiq                        # Prog 2: 17
finish
warp -156.5,-17.2,193.5 CastleOztroja
trigger Daa_Bola_the_Seer               # Prog 2, no mustZone: nil; HERETICS
warp -89.9,-3.25,-127.8 Beadeaux
trigger GeFhu_Yagudoeye                 # Prog 2, none up: Prog 3; four spawned; TAKEN_FROM_YOU; QUADAV_ARE_ATTACKING
trigger GeFhu_Yagudoeye                 # Prog 3, Option 0, up: nil; HUURR
kill MAGNES_QUADAV_NM                   # Magnes' death at Prog 3: Option 1
kill NICKEL_QUADAV_NM                   # Nickel's: Option 2
kill MAGNES_QUADAV_NM+2                 # Option 3
kill MAGNES_QUADAV_NM+3                 # Option 4
trigger GeFhu_Yagudoeye                 # Prog 3, Option 4: 124
finish                                  # Prog 4
warp -63.4,22.8,-117.5 OldtonMovalpolos # onZoneOut, Prog 4: Option 0
trigger Koblakiq                        # Prog 4: 18
finish                                  # completed; Jaguar Mantle; mustZone 11
trigger Koblakiq                        # completed, mustZone: 19
finish
warp -156.5,-17.2,193.5 CastleOztroja   # the mustZone cleared
warp -63.4,22.8,-117.5 OldtonMovalpolos
trigger Koblakiq                        # For off; Better the Demon: 20 (0, 1653)
finish                                  # Better begun
